{"last_link_id": 37, "nodes": [{"outputs": [], "color": "#222", "widgets_values": ["【为什么不是 Wan3.0】Wan3.0 未开源权重，ComfyUI 官方仅以 Partner API 节点（Wan3ImageToVideoApi 等）提供，RunningHub 画布暂无这组节点。RunningHub 的 Wan3.0 走 rhTV 无限画布/AI 应用/模型 API。本工作流用开源的 Wan2.2 14B 双端模型，画布直接跑。\n\n【两个分支】上方=图生视频（默认启用，只连首帧图）；下方=首尾帧（默认旁路，Ctrl+B 切换启用，需要把上方分支 Ctrl+B 旁路掉再启用下方）。两组共享模型加载与提示词节点。\n\n【导入后检查】节点2/3选 wan2.2_i2v_high/low_noise_14B_fp8_scaled；节点6选 umt5_xxl_fp8_e4m3fn_scaled（type=wan）；节点7选 wan_2.1_vae。\n\n【参数】分辨率建议 16 的倍数（832x480 约16:9）；length=81 帧 @16fps ≈ 5秒，改 121≈7.5秒。20步/两段采样(0-10高噪 + 10-20低噪)/cfg 4/euler+simple，为官方推荐。\n\n【省时】可加 lightx2v 4步加速 LoRA（挂 LoraLoaderModelOnly 在 ModelSamplingSD3 之后，shift 改 5，steps 改 4，两段改为 0-2 和 2-4）。"], "inputs": [], "flags": {}, "type": "Note", "title": "使用说明（RunningHub 版 Wan2.2 视频工作流）", "mode": 0, "bgcolor": "#000", "size": [560, 420], "pos": [40, 1950], "id": 1, "properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}}, "order": 0}, {"mode": 0, "outputs": [{"name": "MODEL", "slot_index": 0, "links": [1], "label": "MODEL", "type": "MODEL", "localized_name": "MODEL"}], "size": [346, 82], "pos": [40, -200], "widgets_values": ["wan2.2_i2v_high_noise_14B_fp8_scaled.safetensors", "default"], "inputs": [{"widget": {"name": "unet_name"}, "name": "unet_name", "label": "unet_name", "type": "COMBO", "localized_name": "unet_name"}, {"widget": {"name": "weight_dtype"}, "name": "weight_dtype", "label": "weight_dtype", "type": "COMBO", "localized_name": "weight_dtype"}], "flags": {}, "id": 2, "type": "UNETLoader", "properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}, "Node name for S&R": "UNETLoader"}, "order": 1}, {"mode": 0, "outputs": [{"name": "MODEL", "slot_index": 0, "links": [2], "label": "MODEL", "type": "MODEL", "localized_name": "MODEL"}], "size": [346, 82], "pos": [40, -80], "widgets_values": ["wan2.2_i2v_low_noise_14B_fp8_scaled.safetensors", "default"], "inputs": [{"widget": {"name": "unet_name"}, "name": "unet_name", "label": "unet_name", "type": "COMBO", "localized_name": "unet_name"}, {"wi